msgid "|image14|"
msgstr "|image14|"

msgid "image14"
msgstr "image14"

msgid ""
"Move the ground down ``1`` meter. A label in the bottom-left corner of the "
"viewport tells you how much you're translating the node."
msgstr ""
"Mueve el suelo hacia abajo ``1`` metro. Una etiqueta en la esquina inferior "
